{
  "info": {
    "name": "TroTot VN - Chat API",
    "description": "Comprehensive Postman collection for Chat and Message APIs\n\n## Base URL\n```\nhttp://localhost:3333/api\n```\n\n## Authentication\nAll endpoints (except login) require Bearer token in Authorization header:\n```\nAuthorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}\n```\n\n## Test Users\n- Alice: alice@test.com / Password123 (customerId: 1)\n- Bob: bob@test.com / Password123 (customerId: 2)\n\n## Socket.IO Events\nServer URL: http://localhost:3333\n- Connect with: `auth: { userId: \"1\" }`\n- Events: `message:received`, `file:received`, `user:online`, `user:offline`\n- Join room: `join:conversation` with conversationId",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3333/api",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "conversationId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "messageId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "customerId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Set Content-Type for all requests",
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'Content-Type', value: 'application/json' });"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Authentication",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"identifier\": \"alice@test.com\",\n    \"password\": \"Password123\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Login to get access token. Returns JWT token with nested customer object."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.data && jsonData.data.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', jsonData.data.token.accessToken);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('customerId', jsonData.data.customer.customerId);",
                  "}",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Status code is 200', function() {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Response has token', function() {",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.data.token).to.have.property('accessToken');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Conversations",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Conversations",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/chat/conversations?limit=20&offset=0",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["chat", "conversations"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "limit", "value": "20" },
                { "key": "offset", "value": "0" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Get list of conversations for the authenticated user.\n\n**Query Parameters:**\n- `limit` (optional): Number of conversations to return (default: 20)\n- `offset` (optional): Number of conversations to skip (default: 0)\n\n**Response:**\nReturns array of conversations with last message info and participant count."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.data && jsonData.data.length > 0) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('conversationId', jsonData.data[0].conversationId);",
                  "}",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Status code is 200', function() {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Conversation By ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/chat/conversations/{{conversationId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["chat", "conversations", "{{conversationId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Get a specific conversation by ID.\n\n**Path Parameters:**\n- `conversationId`: ID of the conversation"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Conversation",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/chat/conversations",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"conversationType\": \"Direct\",\n    \"participantIds\": [2]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Create a new conversation.\n\n**Request Body:**\n```json\n{\n    \"conversationType\": \"Direct\",  // or \"Group\"\n    \"participantIds\": [2, 3, 4]    // Array of customer IDs to add as participants\n}\n```\n\n**Notes:**\n- The authenticated user is automatically added as creator\n- For Direct conversations, only one participantId is needed"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.data && jsonData.data.conversationId) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('conversationId', jsonData.data.conversationId);",
                  "}",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Status code is 201', function() {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Response has conversationId', function() {",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.data).to.have.property('conversationId');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Participants",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/chat/conversations/{{conversationId}}/participants",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["chat", "conversations", "{{conversationId}}", "participants"]
            },
            "description": "Get all participants of a conversation.\n\n**Path Parameters:**\n- `conversationId`: ID of the conversation"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Add Participant",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/chat/conversations/{{conversationId}}/participants",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"customerId\": 3,\n    \"role\": \"Member\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Add a participant to a conversation.\n\n**Request Body:**\n```json\n{\n    \"customerId\": 3,      // ID of customer to add\n    \"role\": \"Member\"      // Role: Member, Admin, Moderator\n}\n```"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Remove Participant",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/chat/conversations/{{conversationId}}/participants/{{customerId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["chat", "conversations", "{{conversationId}}", "participants", "{{customerId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Remove a participant from a conversation.\n\n**Path Parameters:**\n- `conversationId`: ID of the conversation\n- `customerId`: ID of the customer to remove"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Messages",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Messages",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/chat/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages?limit=20&offset=0",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["chat", "conversations", "{{conversationId}}", "messages"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "limit", "value": "20" },
                { "key": "offset", "value": "0" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Get messages from a conversation with pagination.\n\n**Path Parameters:**\n- `conversationId`: ID of the conversation\n\n**Query Parameters:**\n- `limit` (optional): Number of messages to return (default: 20)\n- `offset` (optional): Number of messages to skip (default: 0)\n\n**Response:**\nMessages are ordered by `createdAt DESC` (newest first). Each message includes attachments array."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.data && jsonData.data.length > 0) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('messageId', jsonData.data[0].messageId);",
                  "}",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Status code is 200', function() {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Message By ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/chat/messages/{{messageId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["chat", "messages", "{{messageId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Get a specific message by ID.\n\n**Path Parameters:**\n- `messageId`: ID of the message"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Send Message",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/chat/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"content\": \"Hello Bob!\",\n    \"messageType\": \"Text\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Send a text message to a conversation.\n\n**Path Parameters:**\n- `conversationId`: ID of the conversation\n\n**Request Body:**\n```json\n{\n    \"content\": \"Hello Bob!\",      // Message content\n    \"messageType\": \"Text\"         // Message type: Text, Image, Video, File, Audio\n}\n```\n\n**Socket.IO Event:**\nAfter sending, `message:received` event is emitted to the conversation room (excluding sender)."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.data && jsonData.data.messageId) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('messageId', jsonData.data.messageId);",
                  "}",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Status code is 201', function() {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Response has messageId', function() {",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.data).to.have.property('messageId');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Edit Message",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/chat/messages/{{messageId}}",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"content\": \"Updated message content\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Edit an existing message.\n\n**Path Parameters:**\n- `messageId`: ID of the message to edit\n\n**Request Body:**\n```json\n{\n    \"content\": \"Updated message content\"\n}\n```"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete Message",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/chat/messages/{{messageId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["chat", "messages", "{{messageId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Delete a message.\n\n**Path Parameters:**\n- `messageId`: ID of the message to delete\n\n**Response:** Returns 204 No Content on success."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Mark Messages as Read",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/chat/messages/read",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"messageIds\": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Mark multiple messages as read.\n\n**Request Body:**\n```json\n{\n    \"messageIds\": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]  // Array of message IDs to mark as read\n}\n```"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Files",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Upload File",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/chat/conversations/{{conversationId}}/files",
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "file",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": ""
                },
                {
                  "key": "content",
                  "value": "Test file upload",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Upload a file (image, video, or document) to a conversation.\n\n**Path Parameters:**\n- `conversationId`: ID of the conversation\n\n**Form Data:**\n- `file`: The file to upload (required)\n- `content`: Optional message content/description\n\n**File Type Detection:**\n- Images (mimeType: image/*) → messageType: \"Image\"\n- Videos (mimeType: video/*) → messageType: \"Video\"\n- Other files → messageType: \"File\"\n\n**Max File Size:** 25MB\n\n**Socket.IO Event:**\nAfter upload, `file:received` event is emitted to the conversation room (excluding sender)."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.data && jsonData.data.messageId) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('messageId', jsonData.data.messageId);",
                  "    // Extract attachment ID if available",
                  "    if (jsonData.data.attachments && jsonData.data.attachments.length > 0) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('attachmentId', jsonData.data.attachments[0].attachmentId);",
                  "    }",
                  "}",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Status code is 201', function() {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Get File Download URL",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/chat/files/{{attachmentId}}/download",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["chat", "files", "{{attachmentId}}", "download"]
            },
            "description": "Get download URL for a file attachment.\n\n**Path Parameters:**\n- `fileId`: The attachment ID (use attachmentId from message attachments array)\n\n**Response:**\n```json\n{\n    \"downloadUrl\": \"https://...\",\n    \"fileName\": \"example.png\",\n    \"mimeType\": \"image/png\",\n    \"fileSize\": 102400\n}\n```\n\n**Notes:**\n- If file has cloudFileId (uploaded to Google Drive), returns cloud storage URL\n- Otherwise returns local file URL"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Socket.IO Events",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Socket.IO Connection Info",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": null,
            "description": "## Socket.IO Testing Guide\n\n### Connection\n```javascript\nconst io = require('socket.io-client');\n\nconst socket = io('http://localhost:3333', {\n    auth: { userId: '1' },  // Use customerId from login\n    transports: ['websocket']\n});\n\nsocket.on('connect', () => {\n    console.log('Connected:', socket.id);\n});\n```\n\n### Join Conversation Room\n```javascript\nsocket.emit('join:conversation', conversationId);\n```\n\n### Events to Listen\n| Event | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| `message:received` | New text message received |\n| `file:received` | New file/image uploaded |\n| `user:online` | User came online |\n| `user:offline` | User went offline |\n\n### Events to Emit\n| Event | Payload |\n|-------|---------|\n| `join:conversation` | conversationId (number) |\n| `leave:conversation` | conversationId (number) |\n| `typing:start` | { conversationId, userId } |\n| `typing:stop` | { conversationId, userId } |\n\n---\n**Note:** This is informational only. Use a Socket.IO client (like Postman WebSocket or socket.io-client) to test real-time events."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

